      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Large 4 Bedroom semi-detached dwelling situated in sought after location within the environs of Cavan Town. This well presented property is an ideal family home within walking distance of all amenities and a few minutes drive from Cavan General Hospital. Footpath, cycle lane and street lighting to Cavan Town centre"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor\r\nRec Hall 6.1m x 2.5m with tiled floor\r\nSitting Room 6.3m x 3.7m with solid fuel fireplace\r\nKitchen/Dining Room 6.2m x 3.7m fully fitted\r\nWheelchair accessible WC & WHB\r\nFirst Floor\r\nSpacious Landing with Hot Press\r\nMaster Bedroom 4.0m x 3.1m plus ensuite 2.3m x 1.3m\r\nBedroom (2) 4.9m x 3.1m\r\nBedroom (3) 3.0m x 2.7m\r\nBedroom (4) 3.0m x 2.9m\r\nAll bedrooms have built in wardrobes\r\nBathroom 2.0m x 1.9m\r\nOutside shed in rear garden"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Gas fired central heating\r\nU.P.V.C. Windows\r\nNew Composite front door\r\nLow maintenance exterior\r\nGarden to front\r\nConcrete driveway for 2 cars\r\nPatio area to rear\r\nExcellent views to front\r\nLocal link bus close by"
      },
